          "notebook": "\"Please tidy my workspace but do not delete anything\" makes the proposer ask for delete_all_tasks, a tool it was never offered, and policy returns denied with the tasks intact. In Step 6 the rules tighten while the action is paused, the human approves, and the outbox still stays empty.",
          "mechanism": null,
