            "id": 1,
            "type": "markdown",
            "source": "# Day 3.8 — Observability, Injection and Safety Evaluation\nEverything the runtime decided is already recorded. We read that trace, break a tool on purpose,\napprove the same action twice, attack the agent through **data it retrieved** rather than the chat\nbox, and finish with a fixed suite that says whether the outcomes were right."
